                        "form": "most unquenchable"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4a8dee2a-6141-3a1f-95ea-5907265f1029",
                        "entry_id": "95d2d49b-582d-3f88-9355-2e7e2b05f378",
                        "glosses": [
                            "That cannot be quenched."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c031425d-1356-47bd-a453-3cc7184f3ba8",
                                "sense_id": "4a8dee2a-6141-3a1f-95ea-5907265f1029",
                                "text": "After a twelve-mile run in the hot sun, his thirst felt unquenchable."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "30ee433f-c85f-407c-8d3f-37a0b87c5c20",
                                "sense_id": "4a8dee2a-6141-3a1f-95ea-5907265f1029",
                                "text": "Alas! thus ever does the weakness of our nature rebuke its strength, and genius is brought to the level—ay, below the level—of common humanity, by an unquenchable thirst for its applause."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "16171869-b3c4-43e5-ac3c-73c9ba436fdb",
                                "sense_id": "4a8dee2a-6141-3a1f-95ea-5907265f1029",
                                "text": "With an unquenchable enthusiasm for locomotives and their work, at an early age I had commenced to keep engine and traffic-recording notebooks, compiled in a schoolboy's round hand."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "249bcc02-edb4-4888-ba5d-a1f3b9046605",
                                "sense_id": "4a8dee2a-6141-3a1f-95ea-5907265f1029",
                                "text": "President Trump did not need to warp intelligence to justify his decision. But he did anyway, to satisfy his unquenchable ego."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ad7d27aa-4cc3-46f6-8050-41b4a2383b79",
                        "source_entry_id": "95d2d49b-582d-3f88-9355-2e7e2b05f378",
                        "source_sense_id": "4a8dee2a-6141-3a1f-95ea-5907265f1029",
